00:04:10,382 --> 00:04:19,264
你依然拥有代码编辑器、终端、调试器、源代码和扩展插件，而 AI 会在你身边协助你回答问题、生成代码，
You still have your code editor, terminal, debugger, source code, and extensions, and the AI works alongside you by answering questions, generating code,

42
00:04:19,423 --> 00:04:24,900
