explaining existing code, and helping with edits while you remain in complete control of every change.

43
00:04:25,358 --> 00:04:28,324
Solo 模式则是让事情变得更加自动化的模式。
Solo mode is where things become much more autonomous.

44
00:04:28,718 --> 00:04:38,372
你不需要手动完成每一个开发步骤，只需通过打字或语音描述你的目标，AI 就会为你规划工作。
